        "before": "Impact. Revise the closed/open loci consistently in (A.28), Theorem A.2 and the injectivity argument. Distinct open strata are disjoint by definition; closed exceptional intersections are not forced into \\(\\widetilde\\operatorname{Det}\\). The incorrect algebraic identification is central to the Appendix\u2019s boundary description, hence Major under the review standard. No counterexample to the cohomology injections or to the appropriately corrected topological correspondence is claimed.",
